---
layout: base
title: Projects
description: "Research and engineering projects by Mert Biricik: energy data portals, NLP pipelines, OSINT on a SCADA testbed, a basketball RAG agent and systems programming."
priority: 0.9
changefreq: monthly
---

<section class="container-wide pt-20 pb-12 md:pt-28">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="meta-label mb-6">Projects</p>
    <h1 class="display-2 mb-8">Selected work</h1>
    <p class="font-sans text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Things I built for research projects and for myself. Each entry says what the problem was, what I did and what came out of it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container-wide pb-24">
  <ol class="space-y-8">
    {% for project in projects.all %}
    <li>
      <article class="clean-card grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-stretch group p-0 overflow-hidden hover:border-primary-200">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <span class="inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 tracking-wider">{{ loop.index | pad(2) }}</span>
            {% if project.period %}<span class="font-mono font-semibold text-sm text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">{{ project.period }}</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors leading-tight">{{ project.title }}</h2>
          {% if project.subtitle %}<p class="font-sans text-lg text-slate-500 mb-8">{{ project.subtitle }}</p>{% endif %}

          <div class="space-y-4 font-sans text-[15px] sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Problem.</span> {{ project.problem }}</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">What I did.</span> {{ project.solution }}</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Result.</span> {{ project.outcome }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-slate-200">
          {% if project.tech %}
          <p class="label mb-6">Built with</p>
          <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-12">
            {% for t in project.tech %}<li class="tag bg-white">{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-3">
            {% if project.sourceLink %}<a href="{{ project.sourceLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary w-full text-center">Source code</a>{% endif %}
            {% if project.visitSiteLink %}<a href="{{ project.visitSiteLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary w-full text-center">Visit site</a>{% endif %}
            {% if project.demoLink %}<a href="{{ project.demoLink }}" class="btn-secondary w-full text-center">Embedded demo</a>{% endif %}
            {% if project.publicationLink %}<a href="{{ project.publicationLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary w-full text-center">Paper</a>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>

  <div class="text-center pt-20">
    <h2 class="display-3 mb-8">Working on something similar?</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Contact</a>
      <a href="{{ metadata.social.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
